# Tailor Admin Portal

Lightweight admin app for tailoring shops — customer profiles, measurements, categories, auth.

## Stack

- Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind CSS v4 (`@theme` + `@layer components` in `src/app/globals.css`)
- Icons: `lucide-react`; class merging: `clsx`

## Paths and structure

- `@/*` → `src/app/*` (see `tsconfig.json`)
- Pages: `src/app/<route>/page.tsx`
- Components: `src/app/components/{layout,ui,dashboard}/`
- Shared logic: `src/lib/` (types, mock data, auth, db)
- API routes: `src/app/api/`

## Component conventions

- camelCase filenames (`statCard.tsx`, `appShell.tsx`)
- Default exports; define props with a `*Props` interface
- Add `'use client'` only when hooks, events, or browser APIs are needed
- Single quotes in TSX strings

## Styling

Prefer semantic utility classes over raw hex:

- Surfaces: `background`, `background-light`, `background-hover`
- Text: `foreground-heading`, `foreground-text`, `foreground-primary`
- Borders: `separator-bottom`, `separator-right`, `border-[var(--app-border)]`
- Buttons: `btn-primary` (defined in globals.css)

Add new tokens to `@theme` / `:root` in `globals.css` — do not hardcode brand colors in components.

## Layout

Authenticated pages render inside `AppShell` (sidebar + mobile drawer). Use `PageHeader` for page titles. Main content area: `background-light flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 md:p-8`.
